 ),\\,t\\ne \\frac{\\pi n}{2},\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is an integer." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14076578/state.json" "file_sha256" "7e078e637b0a5016d70c6690103f14d012c3146cab810198ec878e6e2ed5d82f"} {"question" "q-162646" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14076578/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2c7e228c7c5c3c966d12a7927a28225e9bc1ff50e1eeb272522eaf8cbee331d1"} {"question" "q-162646" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14076578/state.json" "file_sha256" "7e078e637b0a5016d70c6690103f14d012c3146cab810198ec878e6e2ed5d82f"} {"question" "q-162646" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "2\\pi n"] ["math" "\\frac{\\pi n}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\pi }{2}+\\frac{\\pi n}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\pi }{2}+\\pi n"] ["math" "n\\pi "]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14076578/state.json" "file_sha256" "7e078e637b0a5016d70c6690103f14d012c3146cab810198ec878e6e2ed5d82f"} {"question" "q-162646" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{\\pi n}{2}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14076578/state.json" "file_sha256" "7e078e637b0a5016d70c6690103f14d012c3146cab810198ec878e6e2ed5d82f"} {"question" "q-162637" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "The domain of the vector-valued function $f(t)=(1-{t}^{3})\\,i+3\\operatorname{tan}⁡t\\,j+\\sqrt{{t}^{2}+1}\\,k$ is \n\n$$\nt\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),\\,t\\ne .\n$$\n\nWhat is the missing expression? You m